"human connections. Virtual companions and language translation tools break "
"down communication barriers, enabling people from diverse backgrounds to "
"connect more easily. This growing accessibility highlights AI's potential to "
"create a more inclusive and connected world."
msgstr ""

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
